{"title":"Career Roadmap: 3D Interaction Designer","role":"3D Interaction Designer","summary":"A 3D Interaction Designer designs how users see, navigate, manipulate and interact with 3D digital environments.","facts":{"Current degree":"BCA","Course":"AR/VR / Game Development"},"about":[{"label":"Primary Goal","text":"Build expertise in 3D environments, interaction design, real-time engines, spatial UX and immersive experiences"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Roadmap Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A 3D Interaction Designer designs how users see, navigate, manipulate and interact with 3D digital environments."},{"type":"p","text":"The role combines:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"3D modelling"},{"text":"Interaction design"},{"text":"UX/UI"},{"text":"Spatial computing"},{"text":"Game engines"},{"text":"Animation"},{"text":"Human-computer interaction"},{"text":"AR/VR"},{"text":"Programming"},{"text":"Prototyping"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Unlike a conventional UI designer, the 3D interaction designer must think about space, depth, movement, gaze, gestures, controllers, physical environment and user presence."},{"type":"p","text":"A strong graduate should be able to take an idea from:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Concept","3D Environment","Interaction Prototype","Usability Test","Optimized XR Experience"]}]},{"heading":"What to Build During UG","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Build This","Learn From","Proof of Skill","Gap to Avoid"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Design + 3D fundamentals"},{"text":"Design principles, Blender, UX"},{"text":"3D assets + simple scenes"},{"text":"Learning software without design fundamentals"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"3D interaction"},{"text":"Unity/Unreal, C#/visual scripting"},{"text":"Interactive prototypes"},{"text":"Only creating static models"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"XR development"},{"text":"AR/VR, spatial UX, int