"},{"text":"JavaScript/TypeScript"}]},{"type":"p","text":"C# is particularly useful for Unity."},{"type":"p","text":"C++ becomes valuable for Unreal and performance-intensive development."},{"type":"p","text":"Python is useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Asset pipelines"},{"text":"Automation"},{"text":"Blender scripting"},{"text":"Data processing"}]}]},{"heading":"Web 3D","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn web-based 3D as an additional skill."},{"type":"p","text":"Technologies:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Three.js"},{"text":"WebGL"},{"text":"WebGPU concepts"},{"text":"React Three Fiber"},{"text":"JavaScript/TypeScript"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Applications:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"3D product configurators"},{"text":"Virtual showrooms"},{"text":"Interactive websites"},{"text":"Digital twins"},{"text":"Web-based experiences"}]}]},{"heading":"Performance Optimization","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"This is an important professional skill."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Polygon optimization"},{"text":"Texture compression"},{"text":"Level of detail"},{"text":"Occlusion culling"},{"text":"Batching"},{"text":"Draw-call reduction"},{"text":"Shader optimization"},{"text":"Asset compression"},{"text":"Memory management"},{"text":"Frame-rate profiling"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For immersive applications, poor performance can directly affect usability and comfort."}]},{"heading":"Accessibility","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn to design experiences for users with different:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Mobility abilities"},{"text":"Vision capabilities"},{"text":"Hearing capabilities"},{"text":"Cognitive needs"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Consider:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Alternative interaction methods"},{"text":"Adjustable text"},{"text":"Contrast"},{"text":"Audio/visual redundancy"},{"text":"Seated modes"},{"text":"One-handed interaction"},{"text":"Comfort se